    "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><img class=\"  wp-image-558 aligncenter\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/DLA-Piper.jpg\" alt=\"DLA Piper\" width=\"130\" height=\"93\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>DLA Piper has been named ‘Best Law Firm, Georgia, 2013’ by CFI.</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Founded as a local firm, it is now uniquely well positioned to provide international expertise as well as demonstrate in- depth understanding of the jurisdiction. The majority of the firm’s work is for international clients and sophisticated Georgian businesses. Training of lawyers is a continuous process at the heart of the success of this outstanding Georgian legal firm.</p>",
